# Lambda and CI Workflow

- For `lambdas/what2play-post-confirmation`, keep a working unit test.
- Update tests when Lambda behavior changes.
- In workflow updates, ensure Lambda tests run before Terraform apply.
- Keep README top section hand-authored, and keep the Terraform docs output block at the bottom.
